            0.332
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.334,
            0.802,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Using this generalised form, find a magic square if the centre number is 25."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.377,
            0.846,
            0.415
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. What is the expression obtained by adding the 3 terms of any row, column or diagonal?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.42,
            0.494,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Write the result obtained by—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.444,
            0.723,
            0.464
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) adding 1 to every term in the generalised form."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.468,
            0.698,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) doubling every term in the generalised form"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.492,
            0.65,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Create a magic square whose magic sum is 60."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.516,
            0.663,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Is it possible to get a magic square by filling nine non-consecutive numbers?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
